      "value": "the download mechanic of this game is just ridiculous i never seen something that broken.\nyou forced to download any avatar without being able to skip even after blocking the user or even after reloading the instance.\nyou cannot see the size of an avatar before downloading it... that make me really affraid to click on \"show\" because it's literally playing russian roulette... if i show a 100 mb avatar that's it.. i can restart my game or i'll be timed out non-stop for half an hour\ni tried to analyse the download rate of the game while playing and i found out that even if everyone is hidden sometimes vrchat will download something for no reason...\neven my student flat with gb internet speed struggles sometimes and i'm timed out without any reason (it's extremely rare but it happens) and the download rate is crazy, when i try to count every megabyte i download on the game windows says i downloaded twice as much or even more (i don't think it's because of voice chat or player movement, because even an hour of streaming in 1080p on discord is not as much as that, so if it's the player movement and voice chat that make so much download rate, vrchat dev have to remake everything).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
