  "details": "when you select any avatar from any world the game starts downloading it in the background even if you choose another avatar it will keep downloading the first avatar and get stuck until it finishes downloading then it will start downloading the second avatar you chose this even affect worlds it will not load the world and it will show 0.00/ until it finishes downloading avatar and sometimes it gets totally stuck so adding force stop downloading in settings will help things to get faster and will even lower the requests that vrchat servers get as it will stop unnecessary avatars loading that even the players doesn't want",
